      {
        "role": "assistant",
        "content": "{\"message\":\"Exactly\u2014no new lead record is needed because your profile already exists. The referral opportunity we just created is linked to your person ID (`ba495beb-d7ce-4c1d-99ba-12b0f6ec6baf`) and your company (`9a51d60d-1ca9-42a5-9306-a1dfb805db59`). When the referral link arrives, it will automatically associate any new sign\u2011ups with this opportunity.\\n\\n### Tips for a Smooth Onboarding for Your Colleagues\\n1. **Start with a Quick Demo** \u2013 Show them the core dashboards (contacts, opportunities, tasks) so they see the value right away.\\n2. **Highlight the Referral Link** \u2013 Explain that the link pre\u2011populates the referral field, so the new users will be automatically tied to the opportunity.\\n3. **Use the \u201cGetting Started\u201d Checklist** \u2013 We have a short onboarding checklist that covers: \\n   * Adding their first contact\\n   * Creating a task list\\n   * Setting up email templates\\n4. **Invite Them to the Knowledge Hub** \u2013 They can access tutorials, FAQs, and community forums.\\n5. **Assign a Dedicated Support Rep** \u2013 If you\u2019d like, we can assign a support rep to answer any questions during the first week.\\n\\nLet me know if you\u2019d like me to schedule a brief 15\u2011minute walkthrough for your team or if there\u2019s anything else I can do to help. I\u2019ll keep an eye on the referral link and will send it to your email as soon as it\u2019s generated. \ud83d\ude80\"}",
        "tool_calls": null
